# Advanced auto — unattended epic orchestration

`/iflow-auto` runs a confirmed epic stage hands-off via `/iflow-cycle`, records
`auto_status.md`, and runs the adversarial inter-epoch review (reopen/create
under the overnight confirm).

See `{{ issueflows_dir }}/{{ designs_folder }}/advanced-auto-mode.md`.

{% include "skills/_model_directive.md.j2" %}

{% include "skills/_resolve_project_root.md.j2" %}

## Input

- **`<N>`** — epic anchor number (`epic<N>_plan.md` must be `Status: confirmed`).
- **`stage <k>`** — optional; else earliest unfinished published stage.
- **`loops:<n>`** — override adversarial loop budget (baked default
  **{{ auto_adversarial_loops }}**).
- **`review`** — adversarial procedure only (`/iflow-auto <N> review`).
- **`status`** / **`dry-run`** — report only; no confirm / no writes beyond reads.

## Steps

Follow `{{ agent_dir }}/skills/iflow-auto/SKILL.md` verbatim.

## Constraints

- Off-path; never auto-dispatched by `/iflow`.
- Adversarial review may reopen or create issues; loop re-queue / next-epoch
  gate are separate follow-ups.
